Description: Lock screen keeps its top bar after a resume from suspend
 The screensaver window stacks the unlock dialog and an info bar in one
 column. After a resume the info bar was shown (with no message), took
 45 px, and the 768 px dialog, centred in the 723 px left, sat 23 px too
 high: its top bar (date, time, lock icon) above the screen and a black strip
 at the bottom. While the unlock dialog is up the info bar is now kept
 hidden: when the dialog pops up, when its plug is added, and whenever
 anything shows the bar (logged with --debug).
Author: KiteOS <6760806+iwankurnia@users.noreply.github.com>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-27
